{"root":{"data":{"id":"dmff3loalbk0","created":1793083633903,"text":"GNSS 系统涉及数据","color":"black","background":"white"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmldo88puew0","created":1793688967831,"text":"接收机输出数据","color":"black","background":"white","note":null,"layout":null,"expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmlgajbenuo0","created":1793696358169,"text":"GPS 卫星并不是直接向接收机发送“伪距数据”或“载波相位数据”。\n卫星实际发送的是按照特定规则调制的射频电磁波。这个信号主要承载两种信息：","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmlgaxo74go0","created":1793696389418,"text":"测距码（Ranging Code）：让接收机识别卫星、测量信号传播时间。"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmlgb1ys7cg0","created":1793696398765,"text":"导航电文（Navigation Message）：告诉接收机卫星轨道、钟差、时间和状态等信息。"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmlgbbbbro80","created":1793696419114,"text":"接收机则通过分析信号，自己生成伪距、载波相位、多普勒等观测量。"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmldocqbv5s0","created":1793688977603,"text":"观测数据 Observation Data","expandState":"expand","font-size":12,"color":"black","background":"white","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmlef2xsf4w0","created":1793691072118,"text":"观测量","expandState":"expand","color":"black","background":"white","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmldomd7kg00","created":1793688998577,"text":"伪距","color":"black","background":"white","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmldsc2mkmw0","created":1793689289626,"text":"接收机测量的卫星信号传播时间对应的距离","color":"black","background":"white","layout":null},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmldoqqn9g00","created":1793689008097,"text":"载波相位","color":"black","background":"white","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmldshvioww0","created":1793689302257,"text":"接收信号载波相位的测量值，包含整周模糊度","color":"black","background":"white","layout":null},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmldosvazaw0","created":1793689012732,"text":"多普勒","color":"black","background":"white","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmldsou8f000","created":1793689317417,"text":"接收信号频率偏移，可用于计算卫星与接收机之间的相对运动信息","color":"black","background":"white","layout":null},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmlef91qy600","created":1793691085418,"text":"信号质量与跟踪状态","expandState":"expand","color":"black","background":"white","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmldov665k00","created":1793689017743,"text":"C/N₀（载噪密度比）","font-size":12,"color":"black","background":"white","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmldrymwgpk0","created":1793689260377,"text":"信号质量指标","color":"black","background":"white","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmlds5pfzxc0","created":1793689275768,"text":"载波功率与噪声功率谱密度之比，通常单位为 dB-Hz","color":"black","background":"white","layout":null},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmldsv820j40","created":1793689331313,"text":"锁定时间","color":"black","background":"white","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmldt2focdc0","created":1793689347011,"text":"跟踪状态信息","color":"black","background":"white","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmldt5uorh40","created":1793689354449,"text":"接收机对卫星信号连续跟踪的时间","color":"black","background":"white","layout":null},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmldsxdg2ao0","created":1793689335993,"text":"周跳检测结果（可选，解算前预处理生成）","color":"black","background":"white","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmldt8rh36o0","created":1793689360785,"text":"质量标志","color":"black","background":"white","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmldtbreu8o0","created":1793689367312,"text":"标识载波相位跟踪是否可能发生整周跳变","color":"black","background":"white","layout":null},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmlegexru9c0","created":1793691176603,"text":"失锁指示（LLI）","color":"black","background":"white","layout":null},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmlefelmd280","created":1793691097504,"text":"典型存储格式与实时消息","expandState":"expand","color":"black","background":"white","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmlchgd1wiw0","created":1793685615848,"text":"RINEX OBS（观测数据文件）","color":"black","background":"white","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmlefx085qg0","created":1793691137569,"text":"RTCM MSM 等观测消息（实时传输）"